OL,3,GNEWSA'No rescue required' as boat found
OL,4,Apartially sunk off Orkney
OL,5,
OL,6,FHM Coastguard has confirmed a sighting
OL,7,Fof a partially sunk boat off Orkney.
OL,9,FThe wreck, which has not been formally
OL,10,Fidentified, was reported at about 10:30
OL,11,Fand the coastguard sent an aircraft to
OL,12,Finspect the site.
OL,14,FA spokesperson said no further search
OL,15,Fand rescue activity was required.
OL,17,FIt comes a month after a fishing crew
OL,18,Fand their vessel went missing north of
OL,19,Fthe Isle of Lewis.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
